{"title": "Otto's Irresistible Dance", "pageid": 8898, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Otto's_Irresistible_Dance", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 6 Spells", "Enchantment spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Wisdom saving throws", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp/300px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp, /w/images/9/98/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp/300px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Otto's Irresistible Dance </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 6 enchantment spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to force a creature to stay in place, inactive.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Cause a creature to start dancing, making it unable to take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Move</a>. Its attackers have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. \n</p>\nThe dancer has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Attack Rolls and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_IrresistibleDance</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_IrresistibleDance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_IrresistibleDance\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetTerrain_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetTerrain (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetTerrain</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasHighGroundRangeExtension_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasHighGroundRangeExtension (spell flag)\">HasHighGroundRangeExtension</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Otto.27s_Irresistible_Dance\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Otto's_Irresistible_Dance\"> Condition: Otto's Irresistible Dance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_(Condition)\" title=\"Otto's Irresistible Dance (Condition)\">Otto's Irresistible Dance</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Unable to take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Move</a></li>\n<li>Attackers have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a></li>\n<li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Attack Rolls and <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 11: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 6 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance\" title=\"Scroll of Otto's Irresistible Dance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance\" title=\"Scroll of Otto's Irresistible Dance\">Scroll of Otto's Irresistible Dance</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlike most other control spells, the target of Otto’s Irresistible Dance does not get to attempt a saving throw when the spell is first cast, meaning its turn is very likely to be wasted.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/30px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/40px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a> is one of the very few ways to prevent this from happening.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Until Patch 4 the target of this spell did not get to attempt to make saving throws on subsequent turns, which made it an irresistible 10 round crowd control ability. This bug was fixed in Patch 4.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> cannot normally learn this spell; they may do so by <a href=\"/wiki/Classes#Multiclassing\" title=\"Classes\">multiclassing</a>, choosing Wizard as their last class at level 12, and then <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribing</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance\" title=\"Scroll of Otto's Irresistible Dance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance\" title=\"Scroll of Otto's Irresistible Dance\">Scroll of Otto's Irresistible Dance</a>.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Otto's Irresistible Dance is <b>Obēdirē</b>, the Latin command <i>\"Obey!\"</i></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/d/dd/Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Otto%27s_Irresistible_Dance_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Otto%27s_irresistible_dance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otto's irresistible dance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Otto%27s_irresistible_dance\">Otto's irresistible dance</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034522\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time u